meta {
  name: Get Activity Feed
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}/activity
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  activity_type:
  skip: 0
  limit: 50
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Activity Feed

  Get the activity log feed for a trip, showing all actions and changes.

  **Permission Required:** Viewer or higher

  **Query Parameters:**
  - `activity_type` (optional): Filter by activity type (see Activity Types below)
  - `skip` (optional): Number of records to skip (default: 0)
  - `limit` (optional): Max records to return (default: 50)

  **Activity Types:**
  - `trip_created` - Trip was created
  - `member_added` - Member added to trip
  - `member_removed` - Member removed from trip
  - `member_role_changed` - Member role was updated
  - `expense_added` - Expense added
  - `expense_updated` - Expense modified
  - `expense_deleted` - Expense removed
  - `day_added` - Trip day created
  - `accommodation_added` - Accommodation added
  - `activity_added` - Activity added to itinerary
  - `booking_added` - Booking created
  - `note_added` - Note/journal entry added
  - `trip_updated` - Trip details updated
  - `checklist_completed` - Checklist marked complete
  - And more...

  **Response includes:**
  - Human-readable description of the activity
  - User who performed the action
  - Timestamp
  - Entity type and ID (for linking)
  - Additional metadata (JSONB)
}
